    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>buffer-surface-ring-compact-flags · 3×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 768 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-buffer-surface-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-buffer-surface-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const offsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; offsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const keepOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; keep: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 51u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const DROP_CLOSING: bool = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">fn isSame(first: u32, second: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">  return positions[positionsOffset + 2u * first] == positions[positionsOffset + 2u * second] &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">    positions[positionsOffset + 2u * first + 1u] == positions[positionsOffset + 2u * second + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"19\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"20\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  _ = &amp;offsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  _ = &amp;keep;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  var line = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  var high = LINE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  while (line + 1u &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">    let middle = (line + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    if (offsets[offsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= index) { line = middle; } else { high = middle; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  let begin = offsets[offsetsOffset + line];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  let end = offsets[offsetsOffset + line + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  var flag = index &lt; end;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  if (flag &amp;&amp; index &gt; begin &amp;&amp; isSame(index - 1u, index)) { flag = false; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  if (flag &amp;&amp; DROP_CLOSING &amp;&amp; index + 1u == end &amp;&amp; index &gt; begin &amp;&amp; isSame(begin, index)) { flag = false; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  keep[keepOffset + index] = select(0u, 1u, flag);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>offsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ringOffsets\">ringOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>keep<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"buffer-surface-ring-compact-keep\">buffer-surface-ring-compact-keep</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUBufferSurface/ring-compact-flags · main · 5fd5d39e</figcaption></figure></section>",
